Pure Minima C++
================

This is a C++17 translation of the Minima blockchain node, derived from the
original Java implementation:

    The Minima protocol Java libraries and application
    Copyright (c) Minima Global
    https://github.com/minima-global/Minima

Both the original work and this translation are licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE for the full license text.

Changes made by the authors of this translation (relative to the original
Java codebase) are documented in CHANGELOG.md. This translation removes
functionality that is not required for a core node (notably the MDS
MiniDAPP system and the Maxima messaging layer), retains the Maxima
wire-protocol message handlers for peer compatibility, and adds security
hardening documented in SECURITY.md.

